OL,3,GNEWSAWater park resort plans set for
OL,4,Aapproval
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposed development would be built
OL,7,Fon 19.3 hectares of agricultural land
OL,8,Fbetween Barlborough, Clowne and
OL,9,FWhitwell, with a 512-room seven-storey
OL,10,Fhotel, indoor water park, adventure
OL,11,Ffacilities, restaurants, 600-person
OL,12,Fconference centre and staff
OL,13,Faccommodation proposed.
OL,15,FBut more than 500 public comments had
OL,16,Fbeen submitted over the scheme with
OL,17,Fcampaign group Say No to the Wolf
OL,18,Fstrongly opposing it.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
